			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://bell.bz/@andy\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>andy</span></a></span> I like it.<br>I've spent the last 3 days building a pattern library based on <span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://bell.bz/@andy\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>andy</span></a></span> template (but with included subcomponents YEAH it's been a pain to figure that one out lol)</p><p>There are js functions that I need in only one template and it's a bit annoying to switch between files all the time.</p><p>Also, as I'm here, I never had that much fun coding in a long time so thanks again to you both for the things you put out there so I can tweak them and see which errors they throw at me.</p>",
